如果 H > M > L，SQL 不會知道字串的大小關係，所以你必須自己定義排序規則。

方法一：CASE WHEN (推薦)

WITH PURE_TS AS
(
	SELECT TS_CUST_ID
	FROM BANCS_SK_CUST_INFO a
	JOIN Customer_Migrate_buffer b
		ON a.SK_CUST_ID = b.CustomerNo
	WHERE a.CUST_RE_NO_FLG = '1'
	EXCEPT
	SELECT TS_CUST_ID
	FROM BANCS_SK_CUST_INFO a
	JOIN Customer_Migrate_buffer b
		ON a.SK_CUST_ID = b.CustomerNo
	WHERE a.CUST_RE_NO_FLG IN ('2','3')
)
SELECT
	a.HIGHRISK,
	u.HIGHRISK
FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
JOIN PURE_TS d
	ON d.TS_CUST_ID = a.CustomerNo
JOIN CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP h
	ON h.NEW_CIF_KEY = a.CIF_KEY
JOIN Cust_NP_Migrate_buffer t
	ON t.CIF_KEY = h.SOURCE_CIF_KEY
JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT u
	ON u.CIF_KEY = a.CIF_KEY
WHERE
	CASE a.HIGHRISK
		WHEN 'H' THEN 3
		WHEN 'M' THEN 2
		WHEN 'L' THEN 1
	END >
	CASE u.HIGHRISK
		WHEN 'H' THEN 3
		WHEN 'M' THEN 2
		WHEN 'L' THEN 1
	END;

結果會抓出

a	u	是否抓出
H	M	O
H	L	O
M	L	O
M	H	X
L	H	X
L	M	X
H	H	X
M	M	X
L	L	X

